.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-hook-quick 1 "" "Sway Things 0.3.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-hook\-quick \- Switch Do Not Disturb, Wi\-Fi, Bluetooth, the sound or the microphone: run by the buttons of swaync\*(Aqs panel
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things hook quick\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIWHICH\fR> [\fIACTION\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Switch Do Not Disturb, Wi\-Fi, Bluetooth, the sound or the microphone: run by the buttons of swaync\*(Aqs panel
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIWHICH\fR>
What to switch
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
dnd: Do Not Disturb of the notification daemon
.IP \(bu 2
wifi: Wi\-Fi (NetworkManager)
.IP \(bu 2
bluetooth: Bluetooth (the first adapter)
.IP \(bu 2
sound: The sound of the default output (on is not muted)
.IP \(bu 2
microphone: The default microphone (on is not muted)
.RE
.TP
[\fIACTION\fR]
on, off, toggle, or state to print true or false; without, the state swaync gives a toggle button, else toggle
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on: Switch it on
.IP \(bu 2
off: Switch it off
.IP \(bu 2
toggle: Switch it to the other state
.IP \(bu 2
state: Print true or false, for swaync\*(Aqs update\-command
.RE
